0,Deno (singer) - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deno_(singer),"Deno Michael Mebrahtu (born 23 September 2002), known mononymously as Deno, is a British-Eritrean singer, songwriter, rapper and actor from London. His parents are originally from Eritrea, [2] and he was raised in South London. He came to the forefront of London's afro-wave music scene beginning in 2018 with a number of viral music videos and hit songs.",Deno,Afro-Asiatic
